menu "Audio Test"

config AUDIO_TEST_ENABLE
    bool "Enable audio test component"
    default n
    help
      When enabled, the audio_test component is compiled and app_main()
      runs the audio self-test at boot. Leave disabled for normal builds.

config AUDIO_TEST_SIMULATION
    bool "Simulation mode (no hardware)"
    depends on AUDIO_TEST_ENABLE
    default n
    help
      When enabled, audio_test does not touch I2S hardware -- it logs
      the pins and configuration that would be used and sleeps for the
      duration of each tone. Useful for CI builds and development on
      machines without a speaker attached.

      When disabled, audio_test runs the real HAL_Audio_Init /
      HAL_Audio_Play path against the MAX98357A amplifier.

endmenu
